read 1: abcd
read past the end, no AT END phrase:
  EC-I-O declarative: EC-I-O-AT-END                   in READ 
read past the end, with AT END:
  the AT END phrase
duplicate alternate key, warning off:
duplicate alternate key, warning on:
  EC-I-O declarative: EC-I-O-WARNING                  in WRITE
a missing file with its own USE procedure:
  gone's own USE AFTER ERROR procedure
on after it
a missing file with none:
  EC-I-O declarative: EC-I-O-PERMANENT-ERROR          in OPEN 
